# A Profile of Computer Use among the University of Illinois Humanities Faculty.

**Authors:** Jacobson, Michael J., Weller, Martha H.

## Abstract
Describes survey conducted among humanities faculty at University of Illinois at Urbana-Champaign to assess their current use of and attitudes toward educational computing. Topics covered on the questionnaire include computer experience, skills and frequency of use, computer interest and anxiety, computer software, and use for instructional, research, and professional activities. (Author/LRW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ366408

